Subject: [M156] [wasm] Fix exception propagation check on secondary stacks

Original change's description:
> [wasm] Fix exception propagation check on secondary stacks
>
> `Isolate::NotifyExceptionPropagationCallback` compared
> `ext_callback_scope->JSStackComparableAddress()` (on the central stack)
> directly against `it.frame()->fp()`, which may reside on a separately
> allocated Wasm secondary stack. Substitute `central_stack_sp_` when the
> topmost frame is not on the central stack, handle `WASM_TO_JS` and
> `WASM_EXIT` frames in the fallback switch, and ensure
> `Isolate::SwitchStacks` always restores `central_stack_sp_` when
> returning or unwinding to a central-stack parent.
>
